# Versioned defaults for the scheduled Eunomia community patrol.
#
# Agent routing decision (2026-09-03): every configured model is an execution
# worker with full tool permissions inside the patrol's existing authorization
# boundary. Three local OpenCode workers use different models to process
# disjoint item partitions serially from isolated checkout pools so the 4 GiB
# Workspace is not OOM-killed by concurrent Agent runtimes and builds. Codex
# then reconciles their completed actions, handles public replies and high-level
# coordination, and updates the shared patrol memory. This ordering prevents
# duplicate writes; it does not make Codex the sole writer or
# reduce another model to a read-only/advisory role. Model output remains
# untrusted evidence, but that is a verification rule rather than a permission
# restriction. Codex is the preferred public-response and reconciliation
# coordinator. If that route is unavailable or reaches capacity, OpenCode
# continues coordination with the configured local-model fallback order.
# Each route receives an explicit early final-response deadline. Failed runs
# retain one worker-evidence set plus an event-log handoff so Kubernetes retry
# resumes reconciliation instead of repeating development actions. A Codex
# route that did not finish keeps its event log but drops only the local thread
# pointer, so the next retry does not re-enter an overgrown or stuck context.
# LITELLM_API_KEY is supplied by the existing Workspace Secret binding.
EUNOMIA_PATROL_COORDINATOR_AGENT=codex
EUNOMIA_PATROL_COORDINATOR_MODEL=gpt-5.6-sol
EUNOMIA_PATROL_COORDINATOR_REASONING_EFFORT=high
EUNOMIA_PATROL_COORDINATOR_FALLBACK_MODELS="glm-5.3-flash-nvfp4-dflash2-200k qwen3.8-flash-next-nvfp4-220k qwen3.8-27b-nvfp4-200k"
EUNOMIA_PATROL_WORKER_MODELS="qwen3.8-flash-next-nvfp4-220k glm-5.3-flash-nvfp4-dflash2-200k qwen3.8-27b-nvfp4-200k"
EUNOMIA_PATROL_MODEL_PROBE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=90
EUNOMIA_PATROL_WORKER_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=720
EUNOMIA_PATROL_COORDINATOR_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=1200
EUNOMIA_PATROL_FALLBACK_COORDINATOR_BUDGET_SECONDS=3000
EUNOMIA_PATROL_FALLBACK_COORDINATOR_ATTEMPT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=1200
EUNOMIA_PATROL_FINALIZE_MARGIN_SECONDS=180
EUNOMIA_PATROL_WORKER_PROVIDER=spark_gateway
EUNOMIA_PATROL_WORKER_BASE_URL=https://models.yunwei37.com/v1
EUNOMIA_PATROL_TIMEZONE=America/Vancouver
